    "title": "Beauty Camera - Sweet Camera",
    "description": "<b>Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera & Makeup Camera is the powerful free beauty selfie camera and photo/video editing app with all features - trendy art filter, funny face sticker, AR Makeup effect, retouch & tune face/body, edit makeup, HD selfies, Music Video.</b> Beauty Camera - Sweet Snap captures the precious moments of your life easily and lets you shoot stress free.\r\n\r\n<b>Beauty Camera - Sweet Selfie, Selfie Camera & Beauty Photo Editor with many amazing makeup effects, full virtual makeover, face tune, perfect selfie filters, live stickers, collage maker, frames, video with music effects.</b> With the Sweet Camera & HD Camera app, you can instantly take great-looking perfect selfies and videos and try the best makeup filters and effects from top brand beauty products.\r\nSelfie Camera and Beauty Camera with signature auto-beautification tool for remove acne & pimples, face and body reshape, smooth skin, brighten eyes, facetune nose, make lips plumper, whiten teeth, costume makeup, eyeliner, eyelashes, eyebrows, contour, blush etc.\r\n\r\nBeauty Camera - Selfie Camera helps you create and edit best selfies, music videos, Instagram stories with ease for Instagram, Facebook, Snapchat, Twitter, YouTube, TikTok etc.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 <b>Beauty Selfie Camera, Face Tune, Perfect Filters</b> \ud83d\udc84\r\n\u2022 <b>One-tap Beautify:</b> Touch-up for a stunning selfie photo with just one tap\r\n\u2022 <b>Real-time beauty Filter:</b> Over 300 themed filters, gorgeous effects and diversified styles\r\n\u2022 <b>Retouch Face:</b> face shaper, face slimming, reshape cheekbones, chin, jaw, forehead\r\n\u2022 <b>Eye Makeup:</b> Red-Eye Remover, Eye Brightener. Edit eyebrow arch, thickness, position, color\r\n\u2022 <b>Smooth skin:</b> Drag to smoothen your skin and refine your pores\r\n\u2022 <b>Blemish Removal:</b> Remove pimples, acne, wrinkle, dark circle\r\n\u2022 <b>Contour and Highlight:</b> Real-time makeover cheekbone and nose\r\n\u2022 <b>Teeth whitening:</b> show your perfect smile with whitener teeth\r\n\u2022 <b>Reshape Body:</b> tune arm, breasts, waist, hips for an ideal shape\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc51 <b>Real-time Beauty Effects, Pretty Makeup, Stickers</b> \r\n- <b>Makeup Camera:</b> Multiple choices of the popular lipstick, blusher, eyebrows and contour\r\n- <b>Selfie Stickers:</b> Thousands of daily updated stickers are available for you. The special motion stickers make your photo more cute and cool.\r\n- <b>Exclusive Filters & Effects:</b> AR effects and seasonal trendy filters make you look perfect\r\n- <b>Various Accessories:</b> Sunglasses, hats, glasses, hairbands, eyewear, earrings, necklaces\r\n- <b>AR Beauty Products:</b> Try cosmetics from top beauty brands and try luxury makeup products. Multiple hair color styles make you take on an altogether new aspect.\r\nBeauty Camera & Sweet Selfie with the smart recognition technology helps to make your makeup precisely and naturally fit\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 <b>Photo Edior & Makeup Editor & Music Video Maker</b>\r\n- <b>Beauty Selfie Editor:</b> Edit and retouch photos with fabulous beauty effects \r\n- <b>Powerful Photo Editor:</b> Tap to resize, trim, blur, rotate, cutout photo. Enhance photos and retain every detail \r\n- <b>Music Video & Sweet Snap:</b> Shoot an short video with music and turn it into a GIF emoji\r\n- <b>Duet video:</b> shoot Duet videos - side-by-side response or reaction videos on tiktok or Instagram \r\n- <b>Text, AR Sticker, Filter:</b> Add text and draw or paint on your photo to explain the photo. Distinguish your photos with trending stickers and magic filters\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08 <b>Collage Maker & Photo Grid & Beauty Camera</b>\r\n- <b>Collage Maker:</b> Select several photos to create amazing collage or frame\r\n- <b>Video Editor:</b> Easily add music to video, edit and cut videos in Beauty Selfie Camera\r\n- <b>Tempates and layouts:</b> tons of preset templates and edit collage with filters, background, stickers,text, etc\r\n\r\nCome and Download Beauty Camera & Selfie Camera & Makeup Camera to take perfect selfies, create collage and music videos, and discover powerful photo editor, trendy filter, makeup effects and fun selfie stickers!\ud83c\udfa5\ud83d\udcf8",
